```ts
const liveRows = screen.getAllByRole('row')
  .map((row, y) => (
    Array.from(row.querySelectorAll('td')).some(cell =>
      cell.classList.contains('well__cell--live')
    ) ? y : null
  ))
  .filter((y): y is number => y !== null)
```

But if there are other tables before the well in the DOM, the row indices will be off. Let me check the tables in Game.tsx.

